#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:51
msgid "Enable coo&kies"
msgstr "Prihvati &kolačiće"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:52
msgid ""
"This option turns on cookie support. Normally you will want to have cookie "
"support enabled and customize it to suit your privacy needs."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se uključuje podrška za kolačiće (cookies). Uobičajeno je da se "
"ovo izabere, a da onda prilagodite pravila korištenja prema vašim "
"potrebama."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:62
msgid "Only accept cookies from originating server"
msgstr "Prihvati samo kolačiće sa originalnog servera"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:66
msgid ""
"Check this option to reject all cookies that originate from sites other than "
"the one you requested. If you, for example, visit www.foobar.com while this "
"option is checked, only cookies that come from www.foobar.com will be "
"processed per your settings. All other cookies will automatically be "
"rejected. This reduces the chances of site operators compiling a profile "
"about your daily browsing habits."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite ovu opciju da odbijete sve kolačiće koji dolaze sa sajtova "
"različitih od onog koji ste tražili. Ako npr. posjetite www.foobar.com a "
"ova opcija je uključena, samo kolačići koji dolaze sa www.foobar.com će "
"biti obrađeni u skladu sa vašim postavkama. Svi ostali kolačići će "
"automatski biti odbijeni. Ovo smanjuje šansu da operatori sajta sastavljaju "
"profil o vašim navikama surfanja."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:76
msgid "Automatically accept session cookies"
msgstr "Automatski prihvati kolačiće sesije"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Check this option to automatically accept temporary cookies meant to expire "
"at the end of the current session. Such cookies will not be stored in your "
"computer's hard drive or storage device. Instead, they are deleted when you "
"close all applications (e.g. your browser) that use them."
"<P>NOTE: Checking this option along with the next one will override your "
"default as well as site specific cookie policies. However, doing so also "
"increases your privacy since all cookies will be removed when the current "
"session ends."
msgstr ""
"Uključite ovu opciju da automatski prihvatite privremene kolačiće koji "
"trebaju isteći na kraju trenutne sesije. Takvi kolačići neće biti "
"smješteni na hard disk vašeg računara ili na neki drugi uređaj. Umjesto "
"toga, oni bivaju izbrisani kada pozatvarate sve aplikacije (npr. vaš "
"browser) koje ih koriste. "
"<P>PAŽNJA: Birajući ovu opciju zajedno sa sljedećom će poništiti vaša "
"podrazumjevana pravila kao i ona koja ovise o sajtu. Ipak, ako to uradite "
"povećavate vašu privatnost, pošto će svi kolačići biti pobrisani kada "
"se završi trenutna sesija."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:93
msgid "Treat all cookies as session cookies"
msgstr "Tretiraj sve kolačiće kao kolačiće sesije"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:97
msgid ""
"Check this option to treat all cookies as session cookies. Session cookies "
"are small pieces of data that are temporarily stored in your computer's "
"memory until you quit or close all applications (e.g. your browser) that use "
"use them. Unlike regular cookies, session cookies are never stored on your "
"hard drive or storage device."
"<P>"
"NOTE: checking this option along with the previous one will override your "
"default as well as site specific cookie policies. However, doing so also "
"increases your privacy since all cookies will be removed when the current "
"session ends."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite ovu opciju ako želite sve kolačiće posmatrati kao kolačiće "
"sesije. Kolačići sesije (session cookies) su mali komadi podataka koji se "
"privremeno smještaju u memoriju vašeg računara sve dok ne pozatvarate sve "
"aplikacije (npr. vaš browser) koje ih koriste. Za razliku od običnih "
"kolačića, kolačići sesije se nikad ne smještaju na vaš hard disk ili "
"uređaj za smještaj. "
"<P>"
" PAŽNJA: Birajući ovu opciju zajedno sa prethodnom će poništiti vaša "
"podrazumjevana pravila kao i ona koja ovise o sajtu. Ipak, ako to uradite "
"povećavate vašu privatnost, pošto će svi kolačići biti pobrisani kada "
"se završi trenutna sesija."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:113
msgid "Default Policy"
msgstr "Podrazumjevana pravila"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:115
msgid ""
"The default policy determines how cookies received from a remote machine, "
"which is not associated with a specific policy (see below), will be handled: "
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Ask</b>"
" will cause KDE to ask for your confirmation whenever a server wants to set "
"a cookie.</li>"
"<li><b>Accept</b> will cause cookies to be accepted without prompting "
"you.</li>"
"<li><b>Reject</b> will cause the cookiejar to refuse all cookies it "
"receives.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Podrazumjevana pravila određuju šta uraditi sa kolačićem sa servera za "
"koji nema navedenih pravila (vidi dolje). "
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Pitaj</b> KDE će vas pitati svaki put kada neki server zatraži "
"postavljanje kolačića.</li> "
"<li><b>Prihvati</b> će prihvatiti sve kolačiće bez postavljanja "
"pitanja.</li>"
"<li><b>Odbaci</b> će odbaciti sve cookie bez postavljanja pitanja.</li></ul>"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:126
msgid "A&sk for confirmation before accepting cookies."
msgstr "Pi&taj za potvrdu prije prihvatanja kolačića."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:130
msgid "Accep&t all cookies by default"
msgstr "&Prihvati sve kolačiće bez pitanja"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:134
msgid "Re&ject all cookies by default"
msgstr "Odba&ci sve kolačiće bez pitanja"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:141
msgid "Domain Specific Policy"
msgstr "Pravila specifična za domenu"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:153
msgid "Domain"
msgstr "Domena"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:160
msgid ""
"This box contains the domains for which you have set a specific cookie "
"policy. This policy will be used instead of the default policy for any "
"cookie sent by these domains. "
"<p>Select a policy and use the controls on the right to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Ova lista sadrži domene za koje ste odredili posebna pravila za obradu "
"kolačića. Za navedene domene će ta pravila biti korištena umjesto "
"osnovnih pravila. "
"<p>Odaberite pravila i koristite kontrole na desnoj strani da ih promijenite."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:171 kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:101 useragentdlg.cpp:222
msgid "&New..."
msgstr "&Novo..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:172
msgid "Add a domain specific cookie policy."
msgstr "Dodaj pravila specifična za domenu."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:175 useragentdlg.cpp:225
msgid "Chan&ge..."
msgstr "P&romijeni..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:177
msgid "Change the policy for the selected item in the list box."
msgstr "Promijeni pravila za izabranu stavku u listi."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:184
msgid "Remove the selected policy."
msgstr "Obriši izabrana pravila."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:189
msgid "Remove all domain policies."
msgstr "Izbriši sva pravila za domene."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:193 useragentdlg.cpp:238
msgid "Import..."
msgstr "Uvezi..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:194
msgid ""
"Click this button to choose the file that contains the cookie policies. "
"These policies will be merged with the existing ones. Duplicate entries are "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ovo dugme ako želite učitati datoteku sa pravilima. Učitana "
"pravila će biti dodata na postojeća. Duplikati će biti ignorisani."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:200 useragentdlg.cpp:242
msgid "Export..."
msgstr "Izvezi..."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:201
msgid ""
"Click this button to save the cookie policy to a zipped file. The file, "
"named <b>cookie_policy.tgz</b>, will be saved to a location of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na ovo dugme da biste sačuvali pravila za kolačiće u jednu "
"komprimiranu datoteku. Ovu datoteku, <b>cookie_policy.tgz</b>, možete "
"snimiti gdje želite."

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:209
msgid ""
"Here you can set specific cookie policies for any particular domain. To add "
"a new policy, simply click on the <i>Add...</i> button and supply the "
"necessary information requested by the dialog box. To change an existing "
"policy, click on the <i>Change...</i> button and choose the new policy from "
"the policy dialog box. Clicking on the <i>Delete</i> button will remove the "
"selected policy causing the default policy setting to be used for that "
"domain. "
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete podesiti pravila za bilo koju domenu. Da biste dodali nova "
"pravila jednostavno pritisnite dugme <i>Dodaj...</i> i izaberite željene "
"opcije u listi. Da biste promijenili već postojeća pravila pritisnite "
"dugme <i>Promijeni...</i> i izaberite nova pravila u listi. Ako pritisnete "
"dugme <i>Izbriši</i> izabrana pravila će biti izbrisana nakon čega će "
"podrazumjevana pravila biti na snazi za izabranu domenu. "

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:270
msgid "New Cookie Policy"
msgstr "Nova pravila za kolačiće"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:307
msgid "Change Cookie Policy"
msgstr "Promijeni pravila za kolačiće"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:336
msgid ""
"<qt>A policy already exists for"
"<center><b>%1</b></center>Do you want to replace it?</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Već postoje pravila za "
"<center><b>%1</b></center>Da li ih želite zamijeniti?</qt>"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:340
msgid "Duplicate Policy"
msgstr "Kopiraj pravilo"

#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:623
msgid ""
"<h1>Cookies</h1> Cookies contain information that Konqueror (or any other "
"KDE application using the HTTP protocol) stores on your computer from a "
"remote Internet server. This means that a web server can store information "
"about you and your browsing activities on your machine for later use. You "
"might consider this an invasion of privacy."
"<p>However, cookies are useful in certain situations. For example, they are "
"often used by Internet shops, so you can 'put things into a shopping "
"basket'. Some sites require you have a browser that supports "
"cookies."
"<p>Because most people want a compromise between privacy and the benefits "
"cookies offer, KDE offers you the ability to customize the way it handles "
"cookies. You might, for example want to set KDE's default policy to ask you "
"whenever a server wants to set a cookie or simply reject or accept "
"everything. For example, you might choose to accept all cookies from your "
"favorite shopping web site. For this all you have to do is either browse to "
"that particular site and when you are presented with the cookie dialog box, "
"click on <i> This domain </i> under the 'apply to' tab and choose accept or "
"simply specify the name of the site in the <i> Domain Specific Policy </i> "
"tab and set it to accept. This enables you to receive cookies from trusted "
"web sites without being asked everytime KDE receives a cookie."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Kolačići (cookies)</h1>"
" Kolačići sadrže podatke koje Konqueror (ili drugi KDE program koji "
"koristi HTTP protokol) sprema na vaš kompjuter, na inicijativu udaljenog "
"Internet servera. To znači da web server može sačuvati informacije o vama "
"i o vašim aktivnostima za kasniju upotrebu. Možda ćete ovo smatrati "
"zadiranjem u vašu privatnost. "
"<p> Ipak, u nekim situacijama su kolačići korisni. Na primjer internet "
"prodavnice ih često koriste da biste mogli 'ubaciti stvari u korpu'. Neke "
"stranice zahtijevaju da vaš preglednik podržava kolačiće. "
"<p>Kako većina ljudi želi kompromis između privatnosti i prednosti koje "
"kolačići pružaju, KDE vam pruža mogućnost da prilagodite način obrade "
"kolačića. Tako možete podesiti KDE pravila tako da dobijate pitanje svaki "
"put kad server hoće da ostavi kolačić, omogućujući vam izbor. Na "
"primjer, za vašu omiljenu web prodavnicu u koju imate dovoljno povjerenja "
"možete podesiti pravilo na 'Prihvati'. Sve što je potrebno da ovo uradite "
"jeste da ili otvorite taj konkretan sajt i, kada vam se pojavi dijaloški "
"prozor za kolačiće, kliknete na <i> Ovaj domen </i> pod karticom "
"'primijeni na' i zatim izaberete Prihvati; ili da jednostavno navedete ime "
"sajta u kartici <i> Pravila specifična za domen </i> i podesite ga na "
"Prihvati. Na ovaj način možete primati svaki kolačić sa sajtova kojima "
"vjerujete bez pitanja."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:48
msgid "Variable Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Podešavanje promjenljivog proxy-ja"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:62 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:50
msgid "Servers"
msgstr "Serveri"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:76 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:67
msgid "H&TTP:"
msgstr "H&TTP:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, "
"used to store the address of the HTTP proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Unesite ime okolinske varijable, npr. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, koja sadrži "
"adresu HTTP servera posrednika."
"<p> Drugi način je da pritisnete dugme <tt>\"Automatsko nalaženje\"</tt>"
" i pokušate automatski otkriti vrijednost ove varijable.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:94 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:91
msgid "HTTP&S:"
msgstr "HTTP&S:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:101
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>HTTPS_PROXY</tt>, "
"used to store the address of the HTTPS proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt an automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Unesite ime okolinske varijable, npr. <tt>HTTP_PROXY</tt>, koja sadrži "
"adresu HTTP servera posrednika."
"<p>Drugi način je da pritisnete dugme <tt>\"Automatsko nalaženje\"</tt> i "
"pokušate automatski otkriti vrijednost ove varijable.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:112 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:116
msgid "&FTP:"
msgstr "&FTP:"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the name of the environment variable, eg. <tt>FTP_PROXY</tt>"
", used to store the address of the FTP proxy server."
"<p>Alternatively, you can click on the <tt>\"Auto Detect\"</tt> button to "
"attempt an automatic discovery of this variable.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Unesite ime okolinske varijable, npr. <tt>HTTPS_PROXY</tt>, koja "
"sadržava adresu FTP servera posrednika."
"<p>Drugi način je da pritisnete dugme <tt>\"Automatsko nalaženje\"</tt> i "
"pokušate automatski otkriti vrijednost ove varijable.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:139 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:150
msgid "Use same proxy server for all protocols"
msgstr "Koristi isti proxy server za sve protokole"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:151
msgid "&Verify"
msgstr "Pro&vjeri"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:152
msgid ""
"<qt>Click this button to quickly determine whether or not the environment "
"variable names you supplied are valid. If an environment variable is not "
"found, the associated labels will be <b>highlighted</b> to indicate the "
"invalid settings.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Pritisnite ovo dugme kako biste na brzinu provjerili jesu li varijable "
"okruženja koje ste napisali ispravne. Ako neka varijabla okruženja nije "
"pronađena, njena oznaka će biti <b>istaknuta</b> da bi vam se ukazalo na "
"grešku.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:161
msgid "Auto &Detect"
msgstr "&Automatsko nalaženje"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<qt>Click on this button to attempt automatic discovery of the environment "
"variables used for setting system wide proxy information."
"<p> This automatic lookup works by searching for the following common "
"variable names:</p>"
"<p><u>For HTTP: </u>%1</p>"
"<p><u>For HTTPS: </u>%2</p><p><u>For FTP: </u>%3</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Pritiskom na ovo dugme ćete pokušati automatsko nalaženje varijabli "
"okruženja koje sadrže sistemske proxy podatke."
"<p> Ovaj automatski postupak radi tako što traži vrijednosti sljedećih "
"varijabli: </p>"
"<p><u>Za HTTP:</u>%1/p>"
"<p><u>Za HTTPS: </u>%2</p><p><u>Za FTP: </u>%3</p></qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:178 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:472
msgid "Show &Values"
msgstr "Pokaži &vrijednosti"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:185
msgid ""
"<qt>Click on this button to see the actual values associated with the "
"environment variables.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Pritisnite ovo dugme kako biste vidjeli trenutne vrijednosti pridružene "
"okolinskim varijablama.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:327 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:607
msgid "You must specify at least one valid proxy environment variable."
msgstr "Morate navesti barem jednu ispravnu okolinsku proxy varijablu."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:330 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:610
msgid ""
"<qt>Make sure you entered the actual environment variable name rather than "
"its value. For example, if the environment variable is "
"<br><b>HTTP_PROXY=http://localhost:3128</b>"
"<br> you need to enter <b>HTTP_PROXY</b> here instead of the actual value "
"http://localhost:3128.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Provjerite da li ste unijeli stvarnu varijablu okruženja, a ne adresu "
"proxy servera. Na primjer, ako je ime varijable koju "
"koristite"
"<br><b>HTTP_POSR=http://localhost:3128</b>"
"<br> onda morate unijeti <b>HTTP_POSR</b> a ne stvarnu vrijednost "
"http://localhost:3128.</qt>"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:338 kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:618 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:428
#: kproxydlg.cpp:416 kproxydlg.cpp:446 kproxydlg.cpp:465
msgid "Invalid Proxy Setup"
msgstr "Pogrešno podešen proxy"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:342
msgid "Successfully verified."
msgstr "Uspješno potvrđeno."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:343
msgid "Proxy Setup"
msgstr "Proxy podešavanje"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:406
msgid ""
"Did not detect any environment variables commonly used to set system wide "
"proxy information."
msgstr ""
"Nisam pronašao nijednu od varijabli koje se obično koriste za sistemske "
"proxy informacije."

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:410
msgid ""
"<qt>To learn about the variable names the automatic detection process "
"searches for, press OK, click on the quick help button (<b>?</b>"
") on the top right corner of the previous dialog and then click on the "
"\"Auto Detect\" button.</qt> "
msgstr ""
"<qt>Da biste vidjeli imena varijabli koje se koriste u automatskom "
"traženju, pritisnite dugme U redu, zatim dugme za brzu pomoć (<b>?</b>), "
"koji se nalazi gornjem desnom uglu prethodnog dijaloga, a onda kliknite na "
"dugme  \"Automatsko nalaženje\".</qt> "

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:418
msgid "Automatic Proxy Variable Detection"
msgstr "Automatsko određivanje proxy varijable"

#: kenvvarproxydlg.cpp:431
msgid "Hide &Values  "
msgstr "Sakrij &vrijednosti  "

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:44
msgid "Manual Proxy Configuration"
msgstr "Ručno podešavanje proxy-ja"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:75
msgid "Enter the address of the HTTP proxy server."
msgstr "Unesite adresu HTTP proxy servera."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:80 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:104 kmanualproxydlg.cpp:128
msgid "Port"
msgstr "Port"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:86
msgid ""
"Enter the port number of the HTTP proxy server. Default is 8080. Another "
"common value is 3128."
msgstr ""
"Unesite broj porta vašeg HTTP proxy servera. Podrazumjeva se 8080. Još "
"jedna uobičajena vrijednost je 3128."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:99
msgid "Enter the address of the HTTPS proxy server."
msgstr "Unesite adresu HTTPS proxy servera."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:111
msgid ""
"Enter the port number of the secure proxy server. Default is 8080. Another "
"common value is 3128."
msgstr ""
"Unesite broj porta vašeg sigurnog proxy servera. Podrazumjeva se 8080. Još "
"jedna uobičajena vrijednost je 3128."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:123
msgid "Enter the address of the FTP proxy server"
msgstr "Unesite adresu FTP proxy servera."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:135
msgid ""
"Enter the port number of the FTP proxy server. Default 8080. Another common "
"value is 3128."
msgstr ""
"Unesite broj porta vašeg FTP proxy servera. Podrazumjeva se 8080. Još "
"jedna uobičajena vrijednost je 3128."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"This button allows you to copy the entry of one input field into all the "
"others underneath it. For example, if you fill out the information for "
"<tt>HTTP</tt> and press this button, whatever you entered will be copied to "
"all the fields below that are enabled!"
msgstr ""
"<qt> Pomoću ovog dugmeta možete kopirati vrijednost u jednom polju u sva "
"ostala polja ispod njega. Na primjer ako ispunite podatke za <tt>HTTP</tt>"
" i pritisnete ovo dugme, ono što ste tu upisali će biti kopirano u sva "
"uključena polja ispod!"

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:417
msgid "You must specify at least one proxy address."
msgstr "Morate navesti barem jednu proxy adresu."

#: kmanualproxydlg.cpp:419
msgid ""
"<qt>Make sure that you have specified at least one or more valid proxy "
"addresses. Note that you <b>must</b> supply a fully qualified address such "
"as <b>http://192.168.20.1</b> or <b>http://proxy.foo.com</b>. All addresses "
"that do not start with a protocol (eg: http://) will be rejected as invalid "
"proxy addresses.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Provjerite da li ste unijeli barem jednu ispravnu proxy adresu. Ne "
"zaboravite da <b>morate</b> navesti punu adresu kao što je "
"<b>http://192.168.20.1</b> ili <b>http://proxy.foo.com</b>. Sve adrese koje "
"ne počinju protokolom (npr. http://) će biti odbačene kao neispravne</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:55
msgid "&Proxy"
msgstr "&Proxy"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:56
msgid "&SOCKS"
msgstr "&SOCKS"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:110
msgid "Use &proxy"
msgstr "Koristi &proxy"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:114
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to enable the use of proxy servers for your Internet "
"connection."
"<p>Please note that using proxy servers is optional, but has the benefit or "
"advantage of giving you faster access to data on the Internet."
"<p>If you are uncertain whether or not you need to use a proxy server to "
"connect to the Internet, consult your Internet service provider's setup "
"guide or your system administrator.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Ovdje možete uključiti korištenje proxy servera za vašu Internet "
"vezu."
"<p>Obratite pažnju da ovo nije obavezno, ali ima prednost bržeg pristupa "
"informacijama na internetu."
"<p>Ako niste sigurni trebate li ili ne koristiti proxy da biste se "
"priključili na Internet, molim vas da provjerite uputstvo koje ste dobili "
"od vašeg Internet provajdera ili pitate vašeg administratora.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:136
msgid "Options for setting up connections to your proxy server(s)"
msgstr "Opcije za podešavanje veze do vaših proxy servera"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:154
msgid "A&utomatically detected script file"
msgstr "A&utomatski traži datoteku sa skriptom"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:158
msgid ""
"<qt> Select this option if you want the proxy setup configuration script "
"file to be automatically detected and downloaded."
"<p>This option only differs from the next choice in that it <i>does not</i> "
"require you to suplly the location of the configuration script file. Instead "
"it will be automatically downloaded using the <b>Web Access Protocol "
"Discovery (WAPD)</b>."
"<p><u>NOTE:</u>"
"  If you have problem on using this setup, please consult the FAQ section at "
"http://www.konqueror.org for more information.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt> Odaberite ovu opciju ako želite automatsko pronalaženje i skidanje "
"skripte za podešavnje proxy-ja."
"<p>Ova opcija se razlikuje od sljedeće samo u tome što <i>ne</i>"
" traži da unesete lokaciju skripte. Ona će biti automatski skinuta uz "
"pomoć posebnog mrežnog protokola: <b>Web Access Protocol Discovery "
"(WAPD)</b>."
"<p><u>NAPOMENA:</u>"
"  Ako imate problema sa ovim načinom podešavanja, molim pogledajte "
"uputstva (FAQ) na http://www.konqueror.org/.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:179
msgid "Specified &script file"
msgstr "Specificirana datoteka &skripte"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:181
msgid ""
"Select this option if your proxy support is provided through a script file "
"located at a specific address. You can then enter the address of the "
"location below."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu opciju ako su podaci o vašem proxy serveru navedeni u skripti "
"na određenoj lokaciji. Adresu možete unijeti ovdje ispod."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:196
msgid "&Location:"
msgstr "&Lokacija:"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:220
msgid "Preset environment &variables"
msgstr "Prepodešene &varijable okruženja"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:222
msgid ""
"<qt>Some systems are setup with environment variables such as "
"<b>$HTTP_PROXY</b> to allow graphical as well as non-graphical application "
"to share the same proxy configuration information."
"<p>Select this option and click on the <i>Setup...</i> button on the right "
"side to provide the environment variable names used to set the address of "
"the proxy server(s).</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Neki sistemi se podešavaju sa varijablama okruženja kao što je "
"<b>$HTTP_PROXY</b> da bi grafički kao i tekstualni programi mogli dijeliti "
"istu konfiguraciju proxy servera."
"<p>Izaberite ovu opciju i pritisnite <i>Podešavanje...</i>"
" na desnoj strani da biste odredili imena varijabli okruženja koje će se "
"koristiti za definisanje proxy servera.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:234 kproxydlg.cpp:250
msgid "Setup..."
msgstr "Podešavanje..."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:241
msgid "&Manually specified settings"
msgstr "&Ručno podešavanje"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:243
msgid ""
"<qt>Select this option and click on the <i>Setup...</i> button on the right "
"side to manually setup the location of the proxy servers to be used.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Odaberite ovu opciju i pritisnite dugme <i>Podešavanje...</i>"
" na desnoj strani da biste naveli lokacije proxy servera.</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:260
msgid "Authorization"
msgstr "Autorizacija"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:266
msgid ""
"Setup the way that authorization information should be handled when making "
"proxy connections. The default option is to prompt you for password as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite način kako će se postupati sa podacima o autorizaciji prilikom "
"povezivanja sa posrednicima. Obično se koristi mogućnost da se šifra "
"unosi samo kada je to potrebno."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:283
msgid "Prompt as &needed"
msgstr "Pitaj kada &treba"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:286
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want to be prompted for the login information as "
"needed. This is default behavior."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu mogućnost ako želite biti pitani za podatke kada je to "
"potrebno. Ovo je uobičajeni način."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:299
msgid "Use automatic lo&gin"
msgstr "Koristi automatski lo&gin"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:301
msgid ""
"Select this option if you have already setup a login entry for your proxy "
"server(s) in <tt>$KDEHOME/share/config/kionetrc</tt> file."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu mogućnost ako već imate podešene podatke za prijavu na "
"vaše proxy servere u datoteci <tt>$KDEHOME/share/config/kionetrc</tt>."

#: kproxydlg.cpp:411
msgid ""
"<qt>The address of the automatic proxy configuration script is invalid! "
"Please correct this problem before proceeding. Otherwise the changes you "
"made will be ignored!</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Adresa skripte za automatsko podešavanje proxy servera nije ispravna! "
"Molimo vas da ispravite ovu grešku prija nastavka rada. U suprotnom će sve "
"izmjene koje ste napravili biti zanemarene!</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:440 kproxydlg.cpp:459
msgid ""
"<qt>Proxy information was not setup properly! Please click on the "
"<em>Setup...</em> button to correct this problem before proceeding. "
"Otherwise the changes you made will be ignored!</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Informacije o proxy serverima nisu ispravno podešene! Molim vas "
"pritisnite <em>Podešavanje...</em> kako biste ispravili greške prije "
"nastavka rada. U suprotnom će sve promjene koje ste napravili biti "
"zanemarene!</qt>"

#: kproxydlg.cpp:506
msgid ""
"<h1>Proxy</h1>"
"<p>This module lets you configure your proxy settings.</p>"
"<p>"
"A proxy is a program on another computer that receives requests from your "
"machine to access a certain web page (or other Internet resources), "
"retrieves the page and sends it back to you.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Proxy</h1>"
"<p>Ovaj modul vam omogućava podešavanje vašeg proxy servera.</p>"
"<p>"
"Proxy je program na drugom računaru koji prima zahtjeve sa vaše mašine za "
"određenu web stranicu, dobavlja je, a zatim je prosljeđuje nazad vama.</p>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:41
msgid ""
"<qt>Enter the site name(s) that should be exempted from using the proxy "
"server(s) specified above."
"<p>Note that the reverse is true if the \"<code>Only use proxy for entries "
"in this list</code>\" box is checked. That is the proxy server will only be "
"used for addresses that match one of the items in this list."
msgstr ""
"<qt>Unesite imena stranica koje će biti izuzete od korištenja gore "
"navedenog proxy servera."
"<p> Pazite, obratno je tačno ako ste markirali \"<code>Koristi proxy samo "
"za navedene adrese</code>\". To jest, proxy će biti korišten samo za "
"adrese iz ove liste.</qt>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:62
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Izuzeci"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:72
msgid "Only use proxy for entries in this list"
msgstr "Koristi proxy samo za stavke u ovoj listi"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<qt>Check this box to reverse the use of the exception list. i.e. Checking "
"this box will result in the proxy servers being used only when the requested "
"URL matches one of the addresses listed here."
"<p>This feature is useful if all you want or need is to use a proxy server  "
"for a few specific sites."
"<p>If you have more complex requirements you might want to use a "
"configuration script</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Ovdje možete odabrati inverziju liste izuzetaka. Ako ovo izaberete, "
"proxy server će biti korišten samo kada se traženi URL podudara sa nekom "
"od adresa navedenih ovdje."
"<p>To je korisno ako želite ili trebate koristiti proxy samo za određene "
"adrese."
"<p> Ako imate još složenije zahtjeve onda je možda bolje da koristite "
"konfiguracijsku skriptu.</qt>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Click this to add an address that should be exempt from using or forced to "
"use, depending on the check box above, a proxy server."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite ovdje za dodavanje adrese koje neće, ili će morati da koristi "
"proxy, ovisno o tome šta ste izabrali iznad."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:107
msgid "C&hange..."
msgstr "P&romijeni..."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:111
msgid "Click this button to change the selected exception address."
msgstr "Kliknite na ovo dugme kako biste izmijenili adrese za izuzimanje."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:117
msgid "Click this button to delete the selected address."
msgstr "Pritisnite ovo dugme kako biste izbrisali odabrane adrese."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:123
msgid "Click this button to delete all the address in the exception list."
msgstr "Pritisnite ovo dugme kako biste izbrisali sve adrese iz liste iznimki."

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:135
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adresa"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:136
msgid ""
"<qt>Contains a list of addresses that should either bypass the use of the "
"proxy server(s) specified above or use these servers based on the state of "
"the <tt>\"Only use proxy for entries in the list\"</tt> checkbox above."
"<p>If the box is checked, only URLs that match the addresses listed here "
"will be sent through the proxy server(s) shown above. Otherwise, the proxy "
"servers are bypassed for this list.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"Sadrži listu adresa za koje se neće koristiti proxy ili će se samo za "
"njih koristiti, ovisno o stanju opcije <tt>\"Koristi proxy samo za stavke u "
"ovoj listi\"</tt>. "
"<p>Ako je ona uključena, proxy server prikazan gore će se koristiti samo "
"za URL-ove koji se podudaraju sa ovdje navedenim adresama. Ako ne, onda se "
"proxy server neće koristiti za adrese u listi.</qt>"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:165
msgid "<qt><center><b>%1</b><br/>already exists!"
msgstr "<qt><center><b>%1</b><br/>već postoji!"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:167
msgid "Duplicate Exception"
msgstr "Dvostruki izuzetak"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:181 kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:206
msgid "Enter the address or URL for which the above proxy server should be used: "
msgstr "Unesite adresu ili URL za koje gornji proxy server treba biti korišten: "

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:184 kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:209
msgid ""
"Enter the address or URL that should be excluded from using the above proxy "
"server:"
msgstr ""
"Unesite adrese (URL) koje trebaju biti izuzete od korištenja sa navedenim "
"proxy serverom:"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:187
msgid "New Exception"
msgstr "Novi izuzetak"

#: kproxyexceptiondlg.cpp:213
msgid "Change Exception"
msgstr "Promijeni izuzetak"

#: ksaveioconfig.cpp:252
msgid "Update Failed"
msgstr "Osvježavanje nije uspjelo"

#: ksaveioconfig.cpp:253
msgid ""
"You have to restart the running applications for these changes to take "
"effect."
msgstr ""
"Morate restartovati trenutno aktivne aplikacije kako bi ove izmjene stupile "
"na snagu."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:24
msgid ""
"Note: kio_smb is a SMB client only. The server, if any, cannot be configured "
"from here."
msgstr ""
"Napomena: kio_smb je samo SMB klijent. Server, ako postoji, se ne može "
"ovdje podesiti."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:37
msgid "Network Settings"
msgstr "Mrežne postavke"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:48
msgid "&Browse server:"
msgstr "Server za &pretraživanje:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:55
msgid ""
"Here you can specify the server that provides browsing information, such as "
"the list of servers."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete navesti server koji daje podatke za pretraživanje, kao na "
"primjer listu servera."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:66
msgid "Other options:"
msgstr "Druge opcije:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:71
msgid "B&roadcast address:"
msgstr "B&roadcast adresa:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:78
msgid ""
"Enter the broadcast address of your network here. Usually, this is an IP "
"address with 255 as the last of the four numbers."
msgstr ""
"Unesite broadcast adresu vaše mreže ovdje. Obično je to IP adresa koja "
"ima broj 255 kao zadnje tri cifre."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:82
msgid "&WINS address:"
msgstr "&WINS adresa:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:89
msgid "Specify the address of the WINS server here (if any)."
msgstr "Ovdje navedite adresu WINS servera (ako postoji)."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:102
msgid "User Settings"
msgstr "Korisničke postavke"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:104
msgid ""
"In this area, you can configure which shares to access. You can also remove "
"shares that you no longer want to access or that have been revoked."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete podesiti sve resurse kojima želite imati pristup. Također "
"možete ukloniti resurse koji vam ne trebaju ili kojima vam je oduzet "
"pristup."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:122
msgid "&Server:"
msgstr "&Server: "

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:130
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the server here on which you want to access a share. This "
"must be the SMB name, not the DNS name. But usually, these two are the same."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje unesite ime servera koji želite koristiti. To mora biti SMB ime, a ne "
"DNS ime. Međutim, obično su to ista imena."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:134
msgid "S&hare:"
msgstr "&Resurs:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:142
msgid "Enter the name of the share here that you want to access."
msgstr "Unesite ime resursa kojem želite pristupiti."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:146
msgid "&Login:"
msgstr "&Login:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:154
msgid "Enter your username on the SMB server here."
msgstr "Unesite svoje korisničko ime na SMB serveru."

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:158
msgid "&Password:"
msgstr "Š&ifra:"

#: ksmboptdlg.cpp:167
msgid "Enter your password on the SMB server here."
msgstr "Ovdje unesite svoju šifru za SMB server."

